为队友恢复1.5倍攻击的形势值，并复制目标指定的一个正面状态给自身。","en":"Recovers Momentum equal to 1.5x Attack for a Teammate, and copies 1 designated Buff from the target to yourself."},"ap":"3"},{"id":"1001902","name":{"zh":"有难同当","en":"Share Burden"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"为队友恢复1.8倍攻击的形势值，如果该队友身上存在负面状态，则自身也恢复同量形势值，并复制该负面状态到自身。","en":"Recovers Momentum equal to 1.8x Attack for a teammate. If that teammate has a debuff, you also recover the same amount of Momentum and copy the debuff to yourself."},"description":{"zh":"需要测试一下","en":""},"ap":"3"}],"warSouls":[],"battleSouls":[],"debateSouls":[{"id":"1001805","name":{"zh":"应辩奇才","en":"Debate Prodigy"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"每次被攻击命中时60%几率摸一张回避牌。","en":"60% chance to draw an Evade Card each time you are hit by an attack."}}],"soulPoints":{"war":1600,"battle":200,"debate":6500},"equipment":[{"id":"WP1007302","name":{"zh":"风雅竹卷","en":"Elegant Bamboo Scroll"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"小巧高贵的竹简，颇受南方文人墨客的欢迎。","en":"A compact, elegant bamboo slip favored by southern scholars and literati."},"atkVal":"7","hp":"330","mp":"470","price":"7800","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1018405","name":{"zh":"华丽束腰袍","en":"Ornate Belted Robe"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"采用了稍微好一些的面料并进行了纹饰处理的束腰袍，衣服的边缘处也添加了简单的纹饰。","en":"A belted robe of slightly better fabric with decorative patterning, along with simple trim added to the edges."},"defenceVal":"5","hp":"500","price":"4600","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1026005","name":{"zh":"束发","en":"Hair Tie"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"用来束起长发的简单布条，简单有效。","en":"A simple cloth strip for tying up long hair. Simple and effective."},"mp":"100","price":"200","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1039015","code":"0"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI112715","name":{"zh":"高密郑氏","en":"The Zheng clan of Gaomi"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自姬姓，战国韩哀侯灭郑后，子孙以国为氏。是西汉以来的山东强宗大族，。经学世家之冠。八世祖郑崇在汉哀帝时任尚书仆射，家族“世与王家相嫁娶”，为西汉外戚家族。后因郑崇被诬陷惨死，家族中落。至郑玄时，祖父郑明、父亲郑谨皆未出仕，以农耕为生。郑玄遍注群经，创立“郑学”，为两汉经学集大成者，在《十三经注疏》中占据四部。袁绍、曹操等群雄争相礼聘；刘备曾师事郑玄，诸葛亮称“先帝亦言，吾周旋陈元方、郑康成间”；姜维亦好郑学。子郑益恩被孔融举荐，孙郑小同在曹魏官至侍中。家族虽未显于武勋，但文化影响力冠绝汉末，是连接东汉与魏晋学术的核心纽带。","en":"Originating from the Ji clan. After Marquis Ai of Han conquered Zheng during the Warring States period, his descendants took the state name as their surname. A powerful and prominent clan East of the mountains since the Western Han, and foremost among scholarly lineages of the Confucian Classics. His eighth-generation ancestor Zheng Chong served as Supervisor of the Masters of Writing under Emperor Ai of Han, the Family had 'intermarried with the imperial clan for generations,' being an imperial in-law Family of the Western Han. Later, because Zheng Chong was falsely accused and met a tragic death, the Family declined. By the time of Zheng Xuan, his grandfather Zheng Ming and father Zheng Jin held no official posts, earning their living through farming. Zheng Xuan annotated all the Confucian Classics and founded 'Zheng Learning,' becoming the great synthesizer of Han classical scholarship, occupying four parts of the Thirteen Classics with Commentaries and Subcommentaries. Warlords such as Yuan Shao and Cao Cao vied to courteously recruit him, Liu Bei once studied under Zheng Xuan, and Zhuge Liang stated, 'The Late Emperor also said, ‘I have conversed and associated with the likes of Chen Yuanfang and Zheng Kangcheng’', Jiang Wei was also fond of Zheng Learning. His son Zheng Yien was recommended by Kong Rong, and his grandson Zheng Xiaotong rose to Palace Attendant in Cao Wei. Although the Family did not distinguish itself in martial exploits, its cultural influence was unsurpassed at the end of the Han, serving as the core bridge connecting Eastern Han and Wei-Jin scholarship."},"talent":{"military":"1","commerce":"2","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"郑小同","height":"较矮","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0",